      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Designed exclusively for residents aged 55 and older, Leisure Village East is a gated active‑adult condominium community.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        22
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/leisure_village_east_new_jersey",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Three scenic lakes—Lake Vista, Sunset Lake, and Mallard Lake—offer boating, fishing, and catch‑and‑release opportunities, complemented by a gazebo and lounge areas.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        24
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/leisure_village_east_new_jersey",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Construction spanned 1970 to 1974, producing 1,412 attached condominium units across five models, from the compact Eton to the spacious Hampton.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        30
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/leisure_village_east_new_jersey",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The median age of residents in Leisure Village East is 73.0 years, reflecting its senior‑focused community.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
